<title>HONG KONG: SHK Conv names alternate director.</title>
<headline>SHK Conv names alternate director.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>SHK Convertibles Ltd said on Wednesday it has appointed Warren Lee Wa-lun as alternate director to director Peter Fung Yiu-fai.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
